  "description": "Golden fixtures for trainer.answer_analysis. Each case is a trainer question, a learner answer, what the deterministic gate must decide, and — for analyzed cases — a reference verdict a correct analyzer produces. The unit test runs these against the scripted pipeline; a live-eval runner can compare real model output to the same expectations.",
